{"for_classifying_and_quantifying_tweets_based_on_paul_ekman_s_six_standard_emotions_using_tweets_from_twitter": "The method they proposed is designed for classifying and quantifying tweets based on Paul Ekman\u2019s six standard emotions. This involves categorizing tweets into one of the six emotions (happiness, sadness, anger, fear, surprise, and disgust) and measuring the intensity or prevalence of these emotions within the tweets."},
