{"their_system__can_build__an_efficient_training_dataset_automatically_for_ml_classifiers": "The predicate \"can build\" indicates the capability of Bharat Gaind et al.'s system to automatically generate something. In this context, it specifically refers to the system's ability to create an efficient training dataset for machine learning classifiers without manual intervention."},
