{"s_x_mashal_and_k_asnani": "S. X. Mashal and K. Asnani are researchers who have contributed to the field of emotion analysis and classification using machine learning techniques. Their work focuses on analyzing and categorizing emotions expressed in text data, particularly on social media platforms like Twitter.|Here is another description: S. X. Mashal and K. Asnani are researchers who have conducted studies in the field of emotion analysis and classification using machine learning techniques.|Here is another description: S. X. Mashal and K. Asnani are authors who have contributed to the field of computer engineering, specifically in the area of emotion analysis using machine learning.|Here is another description: S. X. Mashal and K. Asnani are authors who have collaborated on research in the field of machine learning, specifically focusing on emotion analysis of social media data.|Here is another description: S. X. Mashal and K. Asnani are the authors of a research paper published in the IOSR Journal of Computer Engineering. Their work focuses on the emotion analysis of social media data using machine learning techniques.|Here is another description: S. X. Mashal and K. Asnani are the authors of a research paper published in the IOSR Journal of Computer Engineering. Their work focuses on the analysis of emotions in social media data using machine learning techniques."},
