{"deep_neural_networks": "Deep neural networks are a class of machine learning models inspired by the structure and function of the brain, consisting of multiple layers of nodes. They are capable of learning complex patterns and representations from data, making them highly effective for various tasks such as image and speech recognition, natural language processing, and more.|Here is another description: Deep neural networks are a class of machine learning models inspired by the structure and function of the brain, consisting of multiple layers of interconnected nodes or neurons. They are capable of learning complex patterns and representations from data."},
