{"deep_learning_models__are_trained_using__colab_s_gpu": "The phrase \"are trained using\" indicates the process by which deep learning models acquire the ability to perform tasks. Training involves feeding the models large amounts of data, allowing them to adjust their internal parameters to minimize errors and improve performance."},
