{"gridsearchcv_from_sklearn": "GridSearchCV from Sklearn is a tool within the Scikit-learn library, a popular machine learning library in Python. GridSearchCV is used for hyperparameter tuning, which involves finding the optimal combination of parameters for a machine learning model to improve its performance. It systematically goes through multiple combinations of parameters to find the best one based on a specified scoring method."},
