{"ensemble_model_of_bilstm_and_bigru": "The ensemble model of BiLSTM and BiGRU is a combined deep learning architecture that integrates Bidirectional Long Short-Term Memory (BiLSTM) and Bidirectional Gated Recurrent Unit (BiGRU) networks. This model is designed to leverage the strengths of both architectures to improve performance on specific tasks, such as text classification or emotion detection.|Here is another description: The ensemble model of BiLSTM and BiGRU is a combined deep learning model that integrates Bidirectional Long Short-Term Memory (BiLSTM) and Bidirectional Gated Recurrent Unit (BiGRU) architectures to improve performance in tasks such as text classification or emotion detection."},
