{"lstm_cnn_bigru_bilstm_and_cnn": "LSTM, CNN, BiGRU, BiLSTM, and CNN are specific types of deep learning models. LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory) and its bidirectional variant BiLSTM are designed for sequence prediction tasks. CNN (Convolutional Neural Network) is primarily used for image recognition but can also be applied to sequence data. BiGRU (Bidirectional Gated Recurrent Unit) is another sequence model that processes data in both forward and backward directions."},
