{"bilstm_and_bigru_ensemble_model": "The BiLSTM and BiGRU ensemble model is a sophisticated machine learning model designed to classify emotions from text data, particularly from social media posts. It combines the strengths of BiLSTM and BiGRU models to achieve higher accuracy in emotion detection."},
{"bilstm_and_bigru_ensemble_model__constructed__by_the_researchers": "The predicate \"constructed\" indicates the process by which the BiLSTM and BiGRU ensemble model was developed and assembled. This involves integrating the individual BiLSTM and BiGRU models into a unified framework to enhance performance."},
