{"solutions_for_assisting_an_individual_with_anxiety": "Solutions for assisting an individual with anxiety refer to the practical methods or strategies that emotion analysis can provide to help manage or alleviate anxiety. These solutions may include identifying anxiety triggers, suggesting coping mechanisms, or recommending resources for mental health support."},
