{"a_person_s_mental_or_emotional_state_by_evaluating_behaviors_over_time": "A person\u2019s mental or emotional state refers to their psychological condition, which can be influenced by various factors including their emotions, thoughts, and behaviors. By evaluating behaviors over time, such as patterns in social media activity, emotion analysis can help identify signs of mental health issues like depression and provide insights into an individual's emotional well-being."},
