{"deep_neural_networks": "Deep neural networks are advanced machine learning models that consist of multiple layers of interconnected nodes, designed to process and analyze complex data. They are particularly effective in handling tasks that involve large datasets and intricate patterns, such as image recognition, natural language processing, and sentiment analysis."},
{"deep_neural_networks__function_better_at__capturing_the_sentiment_associated_with_the_text": "The phrase \"function better at\" indicates a comparative advantage or superior performance of deep neural networks over other methods in a specific task. In this context, it highlights the effectiveness of deep neural networks in processing and understanding textual data to determine the emotional or sentimental content within it."},
