{"better_performance_compared_to_word_embedding_for_this_dataset_in_some_traditional_machine_learning_classifiers": "Better performance compared to word embedding for this dataset in some traditional machine learning classifiers refers to the observed outcome where the bag-of-words method yielded superior results than word embedding when applied to certain traditional machine learning algorithms on the given dataset."},
