{"recurrent_neural_network_rnn_models_like_lstm_bilstm_gru_bigru": "Recurrent neural network (RNN) models like LSTM, BiLSTM, GRU, and BiGRU are types of neural networks designed to handle sequential data. They are particularly effective in natural language processing tasks because they can maintain context over long sequences of text by considering the order of words."},
