{"google_colab__is_used_for__all_of_the_training": "The phrase \"is used for\" indicates the purpose or function of Google Colab in the context of machine learning model training. It signifies that Google Colab serves as the platform or environment where the training processes are conducted."},
{"all_of_the_training": "\"All of the training\" refers to the comprehensive use of Google Colab for executing the entire process of training machine learning models, including both traditional methods and deep learning approaches. This encompasses the utilization of its computational resources for model development and fine-tuning."},
