{"1_0_1_0_001_0_01": "The possible values for gamma in this context are 1, 0.1, 0.001, and 0.01. These values represent different levels of influence that individual training examples have on the decision boundary, with higher values indicating a more localized influence and lower values indicating a more global influence."},
