{"f_h_calderon": "F. H. Calderon is a researcher and author known for their contributions to natural language processing, particularly in the area of sarcasm detection in social media comments. Their work often involves analyzing emotional nuances and using emotion combinations as features for detecting sarcasm. Calderon has collaborated with various researchers, including P. C. Kuo, H. Yen-Hao, and Y.-S. Chen, and has published papers on the topic, showcasing expertise in computational linguistics."},
