{"p_c_kuo": "P. C. Kuo is a researcher focused on natural language processing, particularly in sarcasm detection within social media comments. Kuo has collaborated with various researchers, including F. H. Calderon, H. Yen-Hao, and Y.-S. Chen, to study how emotion combinations in social media comments can be used as features for detecting sarcasm. Their work, published in 2019, has contributed to the understanding of emotion's role in sarcasm perception in digital communication."},
