{"y_s_chen": "Y.-S. Chen is a researcher with expertise in natural language processing, particularly in sarcasm detection using social media comments. They have collaborated with various authors, including F. H. Calderon, P. C. Kuo, and H. Yen-Hao, to develop methods for detecting sarcasm by analyzing emotion combinations in social media comments."},
